}}'''Lord Casterwill''' was the first known [[Seeker]] in history and the ancestor of the powerful group of Seekers within the [[Casterwill family]]. Casterwill is best known for his leading the 500-year war against the [[Nullifiers]] and his bringing the [[Titans]] to Earth from [[Spirit World|Huntik]]. He was the original Seeker of the Legendary Titans. Many other details of his life, however, subsequently were lost to history.

== History ==
Casterwill was the original and first [[Seeker]] responsible for bringing the [[Titans]] to Earth from the [[Spirit World]], Huntik, in order to battle and defeat the [[Nullifiers]]. {{Source|All Work and No Pay}} At some point in the conflict, Casterwill called for the assistance of [[Cherit]]. {{source|Memory Lane}}

