== Abilities ==
Casterwill was the original owner of the [[Amulet of Will]] and the original Seeker bonded to the [[Legendary Titans]] as well as [[Cherit]]. Such powers permitted him to outlive normal human beings and to fight the Nullifiers for a full 500 years, maintaining himself alive for sheer force of will. {{source|Coming of Age}} In addition to his Titans, Casterwill and his descendants were capable of powerful and unique [[:Category:Casterwill family magic|Casterwill spells]], including curses, barriers, powerful offensive magic, and even the power to seal and unlock the [[Spiral Mark]] at will with the aid of the [[Willblade]].

